  <p>
    <strong>What to notice:</strong> answer before reading, then read the "why" lines —
    they carry the lesson's sharpest distinctions: final goods versus double counting,
    cleanup versus damage in the accounts, nominal against real growth, and why PPP
    changes how economies rank rather than what they produce.
  </p>
